{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>當你卡住、承受壓力、懷疑自己，甚至即將做出無法收回的決定時，AthleteMania Mind 會在這個時刻陪你一起想清楚。它不說教，也沒有性格測驗，而是用快速而誠實的情境練習，讓你看到自己真正的思考方式。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合運動員、學生、專業人士、創業者與創作者。</p>\n\n<h2>情境練習看清思考模式</h2>\n<p>程式設有多個入口：面對真實情境、回答平時略過的私人問題、描述當下狀況取得引導，或在大事前後整理思緒。每日一題不到一分鐘，長期累積後會顯示你在壓力、風險與挫折下的反應模式。內建專注、自信、情緒控制與決策的短篇練習，並以噪音挑戰訓練冷靜。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-98-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-175-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-176-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-99-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-100-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-101-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：AthleteMania Mind</li>\n<li>應用類別：Sports</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T17:39:08.826663+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}